CI/CD Pipeline Details
- CI (.github/workflows/ci.yml)
  • Triggers: push (any branch), pull_request
  • Node 20; npm ci; npm run lint; npm run typecheck; npm run build; upload dist as artifact
- CD (.github/workflows/deploy-netlify.yml)
  • Trigger: push to main
  • Builds with Node 20 and deploys dist using Netlify CLI
  • Requires repo secrets: NETLIFY_SITE_ID, NETLIFY_AUTH_TOKEN
- Netlify config (netlify.toml)
  • command = "npm run build"; publish = "dist"; dev port 5173

